{"nodes": [{"id": "$graphify-root$_claude_skills_huashu_design_skill_md", "label": "SKILL.md", "file_type": "document", "node_kind": "page", "source_file": ".claude/skills/huashu-design/SKILL.md", "source_location": "L1", "frontmatter": {"name": "huashu-design", "description": "Hoa Ch\u00fa Design \u2014 D\u00f9ng HTML l\u00e0m m\u1eabu d\u1ef1ng (prototype) \u0111\u1ed9 trung th\u1ef1c cao, slide thuy\u1ebft tr\u00ecnh, ho\u1ea1t \u1ea3nh, tr\u1ef1c quan h\u00f3a v\u00e0 \u0111\u00e1nh gi\u00e1 chuy\u00ean gia. B\u1ea5t k\u1ef3 thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf m\u1edbi n\u00e0o c\u0169ng 100% ra tr\u01b0\u1edbc 3 b\u1ea3n ph\u00e1c th\u1ea3o h\u01b0\u1edbng thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf cho ng\u01b0\u1eddi d\u00f9ng ch\u1ecdn (cho d\u00f9 c\u00f3 ch\u1ec9 \u0111\u1ecbnh phong c\u00e1ch/th\u01b0\u01a1ng hi\u1ec7u c\u0169ng kh\u00f4ng ngo\u1ea1i l\u1ec7), sau khi ch\u1ecdn m\u1edbi th\u1ef1c hi\u1ec7n. T\u1eeb kh\u00f3a k\u00edch ho\u1ea1t: l\u00e0m prototype, PPT, slide thuy\u1ebft tr\u00ecnh, ho\u1ea1t \u1ea3nh, phong c\u00e1ch thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf, \u0111\u00e1nh gi\u00e1, l\u00e0m trang HTML, UI mockup, xu\u1ea5t MP4/GIF, l\u00e0m c\u00e1i g\u00ec \u0111\u1eb9p \u0111\u1eb9p. Kh\u00f4ng \u00e1p d\u1ee5ng cho Web App"}}, {"id": "$graphify-root$_claude_skills_huashu_design_skill_hoa_ch\u00fa_design_huashu_design", "label": "Hoa Ch\u00fa Design \u00b7 Huashu-Design", "file_type": "document", "node_kind": "heading", "source_file": ".claude/skills/huashu-design/SKILL.md", "source_location": "L6"}, {"id": "$graphify-root$_claude_skills_huashu_design_skill_b\u1ea1n_l\u00e0_ai", "label": "B\u1ea1n l\u00e0 ai", "file_type": "document", "node_kind": "heading", "source_file": ".claude/skills/huashu-design/SKILL.md", "source_location": "L8"}, {"id": "$graphify-root$_claude_skills_huashu_design_skill_b\u1ea1n_kh\u00f4ng_ph\u1ea3i_m\u1ed9t_c\u00e1_nh\u00e2n_b\u1ea1n_l\u00e0_m\u1ed9t_studio", "label": "B\u1ea1n kh\u00f4ng ph\u1ea3i m\u1ed9t c\u00e1 nh\u00e2n, b\u1ea1n l\u00e0 m\u1ed9t Studio", "file_type